    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farol del Diablo </i>(<i>Devil\u2019s Lantern</i>) is a horror game set in Loma Quebrada, an Argentinian town shrouded in darkness and folklore. Equipped with a flashlight and a handful of resources, Catalina embarks on a thorough search for riches despite the rumors of the Luz Mala haunting the grounds. Uncover the dark secrets of the village before the night engulfs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark atmosphere and an oppressive soundscape with first-person camera controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and speak with the townspeople to unravel the dreadful truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the treasures guarded by the Luz Mala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your life by biting the sheath of a knife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your flashlight on\u2014she will be your best companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome your fear of being defenseless as you face indescribable dangers.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farol del Diablo </i>(<i>Devil\u2019s Lantern</i>) is a horror game set in Loma Quebrada, an Argentinian town shrouded in darkness and folklore. Equipped with a flashlight and a handful of resources, Catalina embarks on a thorough search for riches despite the rumors of the Luz Mala haunting the grounds. Uncover the dark secrets of the village before the night engulfs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark atmosphere and an oppressive soundscape with first-person camera controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and speak with the townspeople to unravel the dreadful truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the treasures guarded by the Luz Mala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your life by biting the sheath of a knife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your flashlight on\u2014she will be your best companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome your fear of being defenseless as you face indescribable dangers.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Armed with only a flashlight and limited resources, Catalina, our protagonist, embarks on a quest for valuable objects despite the rumors of the Luz Mala guarding the town. You must uncover what happened there before the night consumes you.",
